| **beastSearch** | `/bestiary/beastSearch.json?term={query}` | Array of `{value, label}` matches | Name → ID resolution |
| **bestiaryNames** | `/bestiary/bestiaryNames.json?letter={A-Z}` | All monsters starting with letter | Bulk indexing |
| **areaNames** | `/bestiary/areaNames.json` | Array of all area strings | Spatial indexing |
| **areaBeasts** | `/bestiary/areaBeasts.json?identifier={area}` | Monsters in specific area | Spatial queries |
| **slayerCatNames** | `/bestiary/slayerCatNames.json` | `{category: id}` mapping | Slayer task lookup |
| **slayerBeasts** | `/bestiary/slayerBeasts.json?identifier={catId}` | Monsters in slayer category | Slayer assignment |
| **weaknessNames** | `/bestiary/weaknessNames.json` | `{weakness: id}` mapping | Weakness lookup |
| **weaknessBeasts** | `/bestiary/weaknessBeasts.json?identifier={weakId}` | Monsters with specific weakness | Target selection |
| **levelGroup** | `/bestiary/levelGroup.json?identifier={min}-{max}` | Monsters in level range | Power leveling |

